# Quality tooling (agent)

Canon: `docs/products/Product-Acceptance-Standard.md` § Tooling.

## Before «done» / PR

1. `pwsh -File scripts/check-acceptance-consistency.ps1`
2. On AuthZ / license / security code: run your local quality script or skill `quality-gates`
3. Matrix: no Scaffold ✅ without negative path; no false `all ✅`

## Shell bans (also in hooks)

- `git push --force`, `git reset --hard`, `git clean -f` without explicit user request
- `git stash` without explicit user request
- DROP/TRUNCATE DB; wipe volumes on `*prod*` compose

## Artifacts

| What | Where |
|------|-------|
| Hooks | `.cursor/hooks.json` |
| Skills | `.cursor/skills/acceptance-closeout`, `quality-gates` |
| Consistency | `scripts/check-acceptance-consistency.ps1` |

Do not add phone-home telemetry to product runtime. Scanners stay offline/local/CI.
